Stores:

Production Line
Style Name
Quantity
Production Start Date
Shipment Date
Required Production Days
Estimated Completion Date
Bottleneck Department
Factory Status
Relationship
Production Lines (1)
        │
        ▼
Production Plans (Many)

7. Capacity Calculation Logic
Read Production Line
        │
        ▼
Read Department Capacities
        │
        ▼
Find Bottleneck Department
        │
        ▼
Effective Capacity
        │
        ▼
Required Days =
Quantity / Effective Capacity
        │
        ▼
Completion Date
        │
        ▼
Compare Shipment Date
        │
        ▼
AVAILABLE        FULL
    │              │
    ▼              ▼
No Spillover   Calculate Spillover
        │
        ▼
Generate Recommendation

