12. Conclusion

The Apparel Production Capacity Planner successfully demonstrates a complete production planning workflow developed using the Design Thinking approach.

The application enables production planners to:

Evaluate production capacity
Identify bottlenecks
Estimate production completion dates
Detect production spillovers
Receive planning recommendations
Visualize factory availability over a rolling four-week horizon
Make informed order acceptance decisions

By integrating Next.js, Supabase, and a simple capacity calculation engine, the prototype provides a practical, user-friendly solution for apparel production planning while meeting the objectives of the Design Thinking case study